{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside an abandoned mental asylum, you become part of a disturbing experiment designed to test thinking and survival skills. <br>The asylum demands careful observation and superb problem solving skills - every puzzle brings you closer to understanding what this place truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1770505816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1770505816 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you begin to lose your mind, you will find yourself in locations straight from a fever dream. Those are the most dangerous places, in which an entity - a doctor - searches for you. Don't let him find you, he can't be hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.avif?t=1770505816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.webp?t=1770505816 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve his puzzles and escape unharmed? Will you beat the experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and puzzle-solving within the asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven sequences set in unsettling, dreamlike locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal guidance and a slow-burn atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a slow-paced, atmospheric experience focused on puzzles, exploration, and tension rather than combat or reflex-based gameplay.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1770505816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1770505816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/e88adb69e0d60c73f380e57b0aa555cabddd3df1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770505816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/e88adb69e0d60c73f380e57b0aa555cabddd3df1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770505816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"You are locked in an abandoned insane asylum and are hunted by an aggressive doctor."},"demos":[{"appid":4052390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside an abandoned mental asylum, you become part of a disturbing experiment designed to test thinking and survival skills. <br>The asylum demands careful observation and superb problem solving skills - every puzzle brings you closer to understanding what this place truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1770505816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1770505816 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you begin to lose your mind, you will find yourself in locations straight from a fever dream. Those are the most dangerous places, in which an entity - a doctor - searches for you. Don't let him find you, he can't be hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.avif?t=1770505816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.webp?t=1770505816 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve his puzzles and escape unharmed? Will you beat the experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and puzzle-solving within the asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven sequences set in unsettling, dreamlike locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal guidance and a slow-burn atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a slow-paced, atmospheric experience focused on puzzles, exploration, and tension rather than combat or reflex-based gameplay.</i></p>","developers":["Silent Clock Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/2768e86c518c93f68aac0ca2f0898d93f7aa515d/header.jpg?t=1770505816","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027820/1972581752/ebbeda3553d28ca9f887ae2f997f6c9926b77210/1766964984/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766965570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027820/1972581752/ebbeda3553d28ca9f887ae2f997f6c9926b77210/1766964984/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766965570","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027820/1972581752/ebbeda3553d28ca9f887ae2f997f6c9926b77210/1766964984/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766965570","id":257256417,"name":"Asylium Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257256417/1c88ac